abstract: "GraphyLoop is a one-command agentic workflow kit for AI coding agents: it wires Claude Code, OpenCode, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, Oh My Pi and DeepSeek Harness with a 25-agent squad, parallel wave planning, persistent memory and an MCP server. Zero dependencies."
